        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantom5613/{size}/1906_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-04-20T04:30:58.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Trajector\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/trajector/48/1914_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Trajector:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div><b>uu wrote:</b><br><blockquote>It was posted by Christopher when responding to what would happen if he has all his hardware out. ( paraphrasing a bit)\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote></div>\nBut what happens if he pushes all of his buttons?\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>He initializes a hard System Reboot. Clean up the game, shuffle all the decks and restart.</p>",
