        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/magistercrow/{size}/2358_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-05-01T12:35:52.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>So I'm new here, but I love Sentinels.&nbsp; I was wondering if there's a thread that keeps track of what has and hasn't shipped out?</p><p>Stuntman looks interesting. Blue MtG player, so...interrupts are my thing.&nbsp; Gonna have fun with that!</p>",
