        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/grysqrl/{size}/1909_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-05-01T12:41:29.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Welcome, MagisterCrow!</p><p>There isn't a dedicated thread that keeps track of what has shipped. Thus far, I believe the only things that have gone out are:</p><ul>\n<li>Foil hero packs</li>\n<li>Previously released material for Everything Ever pledge levels</li>\n</ul><p>No OblivAeon materials or mini-expansions (apart from the character cards in the foil hero packs) have been shipped yet.</p>",
